t;border-radius:6px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/>CGSSB</a><nav class=\"desktop-only\" style=\"gap:24px\"><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/jobs\">Jobs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/current-affairs\">Current Affairs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/cg-gk\">CG GK</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></nav><button class=\"mobile-only\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" style=\"background:none;border:none;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:5px;width:30px;height:30px;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);opacity:1\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span></button></div></header><main style=\"min-height:calc(100vh - 70px - 150px)\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"padding:60px 20px;max-width:800px\"><h1 style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Admin Panel - Post New Job</h1><p style=\"color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:30px\">Securely publish new job vacancies to the portal.</p><form class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\"><div style=\"padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:8px;background-color:var(--bg-body)\"><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--color-primary)\">Featured Image (SEO &amp; R2)</h3><div style=\"margin-bottom:15px\"><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Select Image (JPG/PNG)</label><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\"/><small style=\"color:var(--text-muted)\">Automatically converts to WebP before uploading.</small></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><div style=\"flex:1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Custom SEO Filename</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. cg-police-2026-notification\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" value=\"\"/></div><div style=\"flex:1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Image Alt Text</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. CG Police Vacancy 2026 Banner\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" value=\"\"/></div></div></div><div><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Job Title</label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g., CG Police Constable Recruitment 2026\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" name=\"title\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">SEO Meta Title (Optional)</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Custom title for Google Search\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" name=\"meta_title\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">SEO Meta Description (Optional)</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Custom description for Google Search\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" name=\"meta_description\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">URL Slug (SEO Friendly)</label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g., cg-police-constable-2026\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" name=\"slug\" value=\"\"/></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><div style=\"flex:1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Department</label><select name=\"department\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\"><option value=\"CG Police\" selected=\"\">CG Police</option><option value=\"Vyapam\">CGSSB (Vyapam)</option><option value=\"CGPSC\">CGPSC</option><option value=\"Health Dept\">Health Dept</option><option value=\"Education\">Education</option></select></div><div style=\"flex:1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Total Posts</label><input type=\"number\" required=\"\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" name=\"total_posts\" value=\"\"/></div><div style=\"flex:1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Last Date</label><input type=\"date\" required=\"\" style=\"width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;outline:none;background-color:var(--bg-body);color:var(--text-main)\" name=\"last_date\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Full Content / Description (HTML allowed)</label><texta